WEBVTT

00:05.210 --> 00:07.460
Christopher, Shin. Make your report.

00:07.460 --> 00:08.830
Yes, ma'am.

00:08.830 --> 00:10.210
You've got it.

00:10.750 --> 00:14.080
But, well, it's exactly as you said.

00:14.880 --> 00:17.170
The dragons are behaving strangely.

00:18.000 --> 00:22.210
There was no activity
until this morning, but, well...

00:22.670 --> 00:24.630
They don't seem to be out for blood.

00:25.170 --> 00:27.630
We got fairly close to them,

00:27.630 --> 00:32.460
but there was no indication they'd
immediately attack if a signal was given.

00:32.790 --> 00:35.040
We thought the same thing!

00:35.040 --> 00:37.630
It's like they're preoccupied.

00:37.630 --> 00:39.420
It was like a funeral!

00:39.670 --> 00:42.040
What's wrong with the superior dragons?

00:42.040 --> 00:44.170
In all likelihood, they're somewhere else.

00:44.540 --> 00:49.080
Actually, there's no definite proof
that filth was telling the truth.

00:49.920 --> 00:52.000
I'm not sure why they're acting this way,
but this is a good opportunity.

00:52.330 --> 00:53.630
A good opportunity?

00:53.880 --> 00:58.210
The dragons certainly do not want
to let us off the hook.

00:58.210 --> 01:01.500
If that was the case,
they would have raised their siege.

01:01.500 --> 01:02.540
Uh-huh.

01:02.960 --> 01:06.330
Some issue must have cropped up
for the superior dragons

01:06.330 --> 01:08.500
that temporarily takes priority over us.

01:08.500 --> 01:10.000
This is what I must assume.

01:10.580 --> 01:13.710
It's utterly insulting.
But it's an insult to be thankful for.

01:14.080 --> 01:14.880
Majorca.

01:14.880 --> 01:15.750
Yes, ma'am!

01:15.750 --> 01:18.080
How much longer will the
teleportation circle take to prepare?

01:15.920 --> 01:21.500
<b>Thaumaturge</b>

01:15.920 --> 01:21.500
<b>Majorca Abbott</b>

01:18.080 --> 01:19.290
Ah! Yes, Your Highness!

01:19.290 --> 01:21.670
Um, Fu said it'll take one day
if we work ourselves to death,

01:21.670 --> 01:25.920
so it'll take two days to complete,
Your Highness!

01:25.920 --> 01:28.170
Princess Lia addressed me! With words!

01:28.170 --> 01:32.420
Tell Fu to get it done in one day
without anyone dying.
Being this close to the princess and breathing<b>
</b>the same air as her fills me with ecstasy!<b></b>

01:33.330 --> 01:35.580
Our country has already lost.

01:36.040 --> 01:39.380
On the first night, five cities
and the capital fell.

01:39.380 --> 01:43.000
I cannot fathom just how many citizens
have been devoured by dragons.

01:43.250 --> 01:45.670
The only thing we can do is flee the country

01:45.670 --> 01:50.130
with only the fifteen hundred citizens
we've gathered here.

01:50.130 --> 01:52.330
It is entirely disgraceful.

01:52.750 --> 01:54.330
But we shall escape!

01:54.330 --> 01:58.830
We'll show those loathsome dragons
they can't always have their way with us!

01:59.170 --> 02:00.210
We will survive!

02:00.500 --> 02:03.460
Our people, the corps,
and every single one of you!

02:03.460 --> 02:05.130
That was fantastic!

02:05.130 --> 02:07.630
I expected nothing less from
the renowned Silverware Princess.

02:07.630 --> 02:10.330
Even your excuses for turning tail
were dripping with charisma.

02:11.290 --> 02:13.210
Just who the hell are you?

02:13.210 --> 02:14.670
Knock it off, you two!

02:14.670 --> 02:16.500
So you decided to make an appearance, filth.

02:16.500 --> 02:20.670
I was going to pretend
I never saw you for a while,

02:20.670 --> 02:23.040
but you just had to show up!

02:24.630 --> 02:27.540
You bastard! What did you do
to the commander?

02:27.540 --> 02:30.250
Hold up, hold up!
We already discussed this!

04:01.380 --> 04:07.330
<b>Episode 10: Stakes and Cooperation</b>

04:03.330 --> 04:06.500
I told you to behave yourselves!

04:06.500 --> 04:10.380
This guy doesn't feel strong in the slightest!

04:10.670 --> 04:14.670
Hey, Hesela. Do you think
one of those two might be him?

04:14.670 --> 04:17.710
Totally, Greya! It must be one of them!

04:18.170 --> 04:20.710
This is an incredibly skilled group.

04:20.710 --> 04:23.330
There are even people who are
stronger than Leo here.

04:23.330 --> 04:24.170
But...

04:24.170 --> 04:25.960
What happened to the guards?

04:25.960 --> 04:29.790
I asked them to let us through,
and they very kindly obliged.

04:29.790 --> 04:30.710
What?

04:31.040 --> 04:34.170
We'd like to lend you a hand
in your escape plan.

04:35.000 --> 04:37.330
I got the gist of your plan.

04:37.330 --> 04:39.630
You want to use dragon's blood
as a magical energy source

04:39.630 --> 04:41.500
and teleport out of the country.

04:41.500 --> 04:42.630
Am I correct?

04:43.170 --> 04:45.210
I think that's a solid plan.

04:45.210 --> 04:47.380
But it won't be successful.

04:47.380 --> 04:48.830
The reason is simple.

04:48.830 --> 04:51.210
The difference in military power between
you and your adversary is too great.

04:51.210 --> 04:54.380
If you allow us to work together with you,

04:54.380 --> 04:56.460
I will give you detailed intel
about the enemy.

04:56.460 --> 04:58.130
Better yet,

04:58.130 --> 05:01.380
I can provide you a superweapon capable of
slaying superior dragons unassisted.

05:01.670 --> 05:03.290
Ragna the Reaper.

05:03.880 --> 05:08.630
We must cooperate to take down the
two superior dragons who are our enemies.

05:08.920 --> 05:10.580
If we don't...

05:11.080 --> 05:13.750
We'll all die here together.

05:15.040 --> 05:19.250
So his name is Ragna!

05:19.250 --> 05:20.790
You'd like...

05:20.790 --> 05:21.790
to help?

05:21.790 --> 05:23.500
Princess...
Major, give us an explanation!<b>
It's written all over her face!</b>

05:23.500 --> 05:25.500
Don't talk all at once!
I can't understand a thing you're saying!

05:25.500 --> 05:28.670
What should I do?
Her Highness is losing it again!

05:35.000 --> 05:37.420
You want to... help?

05:38.540 --> 05:42.250
What sort of drivel is that, filth?

05:42.630 --> 05:46.420
You're a stain that just can't be scrubbed
from the toilet bowl of this world!

05:46.880 --> 05:48.670
It's impossible for us to cooperate.

05:48.670 --> 05:50.290
I know this.

05:50.880 --> 05:53.330
You don't play well with others.

05:53.330 --> 05:55.790
You merely use others and get them killed.

05:56.540 --> 05:59.000
This isn't your style, Commander.

06:00.170 --> 06:02.080
Just get straight to the point,
like you usually do.

06:03.580 --> 06:06.250
Do we kill him? Or not?

06:06.960 --> 06:08.130
Hold on there.

06:08.540 --> 06:10.630
It's my job to kill him.

06:10.630 --> 06:12.040
We won't work with you!

06:12.040 --> 06:13.540
Go back to your cell!

06:13.540 --> 06:15.420
The next time I see your face, I'll kill you!

06:15.420 --> 06:17.290
Y-you too, over there!

06:17.290 --> 06:19.500
The Mad Maestro, Olto Zora.

06:21.500 --> 06:23.790
The Sixth Seat of the Blood of the Wing.

06:23.790 --> 06:28.080
His primary role is managing
and leading military matters.

06:28.420 --> 06:31.330
His power is Chemical Synthesis.

06:31.710 --> 06:34.130
He can make potent drugs
that instantly kill living beings

06:34.130 --> 06:36.380
and drugs that hypnotize his targets.

06:36.380 --> 06:40.040
He can alter his blood to create
a vast array of compounds

06:40.040 --> 06:42.880
and can spray them over
a wide area as a mist.

06:43.210 --> 06:46.580
But these chemicals are instantly
rendered ineffective in sunlight,

06:46.580 --> 06:48.880
and silverine can stop them.

06:48.880 --> 06:51.420
Having that information should
allow you to combat against them.

06:51.420 --> 06:55.290
If anything, it's more of a nuisance
when he uses chemicals on his own forces.

06:55.630 --> 06:59.710
Thanks to the chemicals, his dragon army's
power will be multiplied several times over,

06:59.710 --> 07:04.000
and he'll have complete and utter control
over his hypnotized forces.

07:04.250 --> 07:08.500
Of course, since he's a superior dragon,
his own power is tremendous.

07:08.710 --> 07:10.830
Where'd he get this intel?

07:10.830 --> 07:14.250
I've never heard such detailed information
about superior dragons.

07:14.630 --> 07:18.250
What guarantee do we have
that your information is true?

07:18.250 --> 07:20.630
If I was lying, you'd be able to tell,
wouldn't you?

07:20.630 --> 07:22.580
Your very existence is so fishy,

07:22.580 --> 07:24.500
I don't know if you're
telling the truth or not!

07:24.500 --> 07:26.460
So it doesn't matter what I say?

07:26.460 --> 07:27.460
Such a windbag!

07:28.670 --> 07:31.210
Then let's tag in another player.

07:32.330 --> 07:33.170
Hwah!

07:33.420 --> 07:34.420
Hwah?

07:35.210 --> 07:37.500
Go on, persuade the Silverware Princess.

07:37.500 --> 07:39.960
There's no way I can do that!

07:39.960 --> 07:41.460
That's more up your alley.

07:41.460 --> 07:43.920
Me and that woman are totally incompatible.

07:43.920 --> 07:44.830
But...

07:44.830 --> 07:45.920
It'll be fine.

07:45.920 --> 07:49.290
You could probably spew utter garbage,
and her fondness for you would only grow.

07:49.290 --> 07:50.710
That can't be true.

07:51.210 --> 07:52.880
You've made up your mind, right?

07:52.880 --> 07:54.580
You're going to stay here and fight.

07:56.460 --> 07:59.540
Not long from now,
I estimate that the number of dragons

07:59.540 --> 08:02.170
attacking this base will be
at least ten thousand.

08:02.630 --> 08:05.880
Nine thousand inferior dragons.
A thousand medial dragons.

08:05.880 --> 08:08.580
About forty to fifty will be mature dragons.

08:08.880 --> 08:13.040
They also have a mobile front to
transport them, the Writhing Shade.

08:13.460 --> 08:16.750
There's a high probability the
Thirteenth Seat has been mobilized too.

08:17.000 --> 08:21.580
Two superior dragons will lead them:
Olto Zora and Taratectra.

08:21.580 --> 08:23.960
Their military force will be total overkill.

08:24.290 --> 08:29.750
There are 350 soldiers here, as well as
1,500 civilians under their protection.

08:29.750 --> 08:31.670
None will survive.

08:32.130 --> 08:36.330
Were the Silverware Princess
and her comrades in your future?

08:38.040 --> 08:39.750
This is my proposal.

08:40.880 --> 08:43.000
If you promise to follow my orders

08:43.000 --> 08:47.630
and give up on Ultimatia for a short while
so we can escape the country,

08:47.630 --> 08:50.210
I'll use the full extent of my powers

08:50.210 --> 08:53.250
to make sure the humans at this base
escape the dragons.

08:53.710 --> 08:57.790
And when I say the full extent of my powers,
that's including you.

08:58.920 --> 09:02.330
Break it off with me and go back
to the capital by yourself.

09:02.330 --> 09:08.130
Or stay and fight to protect the people here,
then flee the country together.

09:08.130 --> 09:09.750
What will you decide?

09:11.920 --> 09:13.290
Miss Silverware Princess.

09:13.290 --> 09:16.380
Wh-wh-wh-what? I won't work with you!

09:16.380 --> 09:19.670
D-don't think that just because you're
kind of a looker that I'll listen to you!

09:19.670 --> 09:21.250
Earlier...
D-don't think that just because you're<b>
</b>kind of a looker that I'll listen to you!<b></b>

09:21.630 --> 09:26.210
You called him a stain that just can't be
scrubbed from the toilet bowl of this world.

09:26.210 --> 09:28.670
That's actually very accurate, I think.

09:28.960 --> 09:29.960
What?

09:30.420 --> 09:32.880
He's a despicable person.

09:32.880 --> 09:37.420
He loves tormenting others
and gets kicks from it.

09:37.420 --> 09:40.080
Honestly, he's kind of a piece of shit.

09:40.420 --> 09:41.920
A piece of shit!

09:42.500 --> 09:45.580
I often wonder why a guy like him
was even born.

09:45.580 --> 09:48.880
I always think about how everyone would be
better off if I could just kill him already.

09:48.880 --> 09:52.380
But the one thing you can trust about him
is his desire to kill dragons!

09:53.750 --> 09:55.830
That's why I joined forces with him.

09:56.170 --> 10:01.670
I decided that the two of us are going to
exterminate dragonkind together as a team!

10:02.670 --> 10:05.960
Exterminate... all the dragons?

10:06.630 --> 10:08.960
Hunting dragons is my forte!

10:08.960 --> 10:10.670
I'm better at it than
anyone else in the world!

10:11.170 --> 10:13.290
Use me, Silverware Princess!

10:13.290 --> 10:15.040
I promise I can help you!

10:20.000 --> 10:22.630
Huh? What's with that facial expression?

10:23.000 --> 10:24.380
Did I make her mad?

10:25.960 --> 10:29.880
The man she fell in love with at first sight
is ardently pleading her to use him.

10:29.880 --> 10:33.460
And she is just barely resisting
screaming, "Yes!"

10:33.460 --> 10:34.630
However...

10:34.630 --> 10:36.330
You must not agree, Princess Lia!

10:36.330 --> 10:38.500
That man is undoubtably a pervert!

10:38.500 --> 10:43.380
He's the kind of degenerate who puts up
photos of his crush all over his bedroom!

10:43.380 --> 10:46.830
I know he does! I can always
sniff out other freaks like me!

10:46.830 --> 10:49.670
I know for a fact he's depraved!

10:49.670 --> 10:51.880
But Ragna is her first love.

10:51.880 --> 10:54.130
She doesn't know how to act around him.

10:54.130 --> 10:58.500
And she can't allow herself to look like
a pathetic simp in front of the corps.

10:58.500 --> 11:00.210
Thus, consequently...

11:00.540 --> 11:04.000
Very well. I accept your proposal.

11:04.460 --> 11:05.830
But do not be mistaken!

11:06.170 --> 11:11.000
I'm temporarily borrowing your power
for strategic purposes and nothing more!

11:11.000 --> 11:14.790
I d-d-didn't make this decision because of
any personal feelings I have for you!

11:14.790 --> 11:16.880
Do not be mistaken!

11:17.580 --> 11:20.580
That was like a bad tsundere impression.

11:24.500 --> 11:26.830
What's so funny, filth!

11:27.420 --> 11:28.830
Sorry!

11:29.210 --> 11:31.170
That really tickled my funny bone!

11:31.830 --> 11:33.290
Nice play.

11:33.290 --> 11:35.790
I'm not a fan of being called
a piece of shit,

11:35.790 --> 11:38.540
but I'll let it slide since the
Silverware Princess had me in stitches.

11:38.540 --> 11:40.540
You told me to do it.

11:40.540 --> 11:43.170
I didn't tell you to call me a piece of shit.

11:43.380 --> 11:45.420
Is this a positive thing?

11:45.420 --> 11:48.710
Well, it's better than them
being outright hostile.

11:48.710 --> 11:50.750
But still... I just don't understand!

11:50.750 --> 11:52.880
Are you serious, Commander?

11:52.880 --> 11:54.420
I'm very serious!

11:54.420 --> 11:55.830
What about my fight with them?

11:55.830 --> 11:57.380
That will have to be postponed!

11:57.670 --> 12:00.750
A most excellent decision,
Silverware Princess!

12:00.750 --> 12:05.830
We'll certainly pulverize those vile dragons
with our combined forces.

12:05.830 --> 12:10.630
First, let's modify the plan
based on my intel-

12:10.630 --> 12:13.790
You'll cough up the information
about the dragons, and that's it.

12:13.790 --> 12:15.880
I will be the one doing the planning.

12:15.880 --> 12:18.330
That sure takes a load off my shoulders!

12:18.330 --> 12:20.500
Just please do make sure
your plan has no holes.

12:20.500 --> 12:22.830
It'd be a pain for me to have to
patch them later.

12:22.830 --> 12:23.920
Hmph!

12:23.920 --> 12:26.500
Then riddle me this.

12:26.960 --> 12:31.040
A few hours ago, something about
the dragons sieging us changed.

12:31.420 --> 12:34.920
If you know what happened to them, tell us.

12:34.920 --> 12:36.330
Ah, yes!

12:36.330 --> 12:41.000
That's because we fought against
the Winged Monarch in the capital.

12:41.000 --> 12:42.000
What?

12:42.000 --> 12:44.460
They're probably going into a frenzy

12:44.460 --> 12:47.750
and rushing off to the capital
right about now.

12:55.040 --> 12:59.000
Why do we even keep you around,
you senile old man!

13:00.880 --> 13:03.330
I have no excuse I can give you.

13:03.830 --> 13:06.130
Where is the progenitor now?

13:06.460 --> 13:08.330
The progenitor is...

13:12.790 --> 13:14.500
Why is this happening?

13:14.500 --> 13:17.130
So you've lost control of time, huh?

13:17.750 --> 13:19.500
I've said it before.

13:20.000 --> 13:24.750
Ultimate power that you get from
someone else is fickle.

13:27.210 --> 13:28.920
Why are you here?

13:29.290 --> 13:33.290
I told Nebulim not to let anyone enter!

13:33.290 --> 13:35.420
He let me waltz right in.

13:35.790 --> 13:37.540
That can't be true!

13:37.540 --> 13:40.040
You clearly must have threatened him
and forced your way in!

13:40.500 --> 13:43.630
Leave at once! I'm not in the mood
to chitchat with you n-

13:43.630 --> 13:44.750
Got you a souvenir.

13:44.750 --> 13:47.130
Wh-who is that?

13:47.130 --> 13:51.580
Hey, c'mon now. Did you actually forget
what you sent your errand boy to do?

13:51.580 --> 13:54.500
This is the person who killed Trois?

13:54.920 --> 13:56.880
Not convinced?

13:56.880 --> 14:01.040
You don't think a lowly hunter
could've killed that dumb windbag, huh?

14:01.380 --> 14:04.830
Well, this guy was at the bottom of
the barrel when it came to strength,

14:04.830 --> 14:07.750
but he had a good death.

14:09.210 --> 14:12.630
Guess what he said right before he croaked?

14:12.630 --> 14:13.960
I don't want to hear it!

14:14.420 --> 14:16.710
Finding amusement in the
last words of someone

14:16.710 --> 14:18.960
who suffered while dying
is in such poor taste!

14:18.960 --> 14:21.170
If you say so.

14:21.170 --> 14:24.790
But to me, pretty much everyone else
in the world is insignificant trash.

14:24.790 --> 14:27.960
I haven't faced many opponents
who wowed me.

14:28.250 --> 14:31.380
And what was this guy's attitude
when he looked death in the eyes?

14:31.380 --> 14:34.540
He was a weakling, yeah.
But he was a dragon hunter to the core.

14:37.500 --> 14:39.880
But if you ain't interested, so be it.

14:39.880 --> 14:43.420
I'll just keep his last words
between me and him.

14:46.000 --> 14:47.750
Then how 'bout this?

14:48.130 --> 14:50.330
One of the dragon hunters
I dealt with had it.

14:53.040 --> 14:55.710
The craftsmanship is crude for a sword,

14:55.710 --> 14:59.580
but the amount of silverine infused in it
and its chilling power is bananas.

14:59.790 --> 15:03.880
Even I have to grip it with everything
I've got or my hand gets numb.

15:04.250 --> 15:07.580
P-please get that thing away from me!

15:07.580 --> 15:10.080
Don't be all shook up by it. Look, see!

15:10.080 --> 15:11.420
St-stop it!

15:11.420 --> 15:13.040
No! Seriously!

15:13.040 --> 15:15.960
I said stop it!

15:23.210 --> 15:25.330
What are you playing at?

15:25.830 --> 15:28.420
You're holding it. The sword.

15:29.130 --> 15:30.540
It's cold!

15:30.540 --> 15:34.040
Want me to tell you why
you can't control time anymore?

15:34.790 --> 15:36.540
You're probably thinking,

15:36.540 --> 15:40.080
"God is disappointed in my worthless,
pathetic self," aren't ya?

15:40.330 --> 15:43.710
Don't worry.
It's nothing as dramatic as that.

15:44.130 --> 15:47.080
The reason you can't control time is simple.

15:48.080 --> 15:50.210
It's because you've lost in your heart.

15:50.500 --> 15:51.710
My heart?

15:51.710 --> 15:55.330
Magic is a means to change the world.

15:55.330 --> 15:57.670
You need three things to do that.

15:57.920 --> 16:00.460
You need the magical power
to create change.

16:00.460 --> 16:03.250
You need the process that gives
direction to that change.

16:03.500 --> 16:08.830
And lastly, you need the confidence to control
the change once it's been actualized.

16:08.830 --> 16:11.790
Y-you're saying it's a mental problem?

16:11.790 --> 16:14.000
I bet every time you use magic,

16:14.000 --> 16:16.830
the image of your enemy
surges through your mind, right?

16:18.710 --> 16:22.210
That enemy could move even though
I made the world fall still!

16:22.210 --> 16:24.540
Even though I did not give him
permission to move,

16:24.540 --> 16:27.000
he attacked me while time was stopped!

16:27.290 --> 16:30.080
I dunno why he didn't stop moving.

16:30.080 --> 16:35.210
But the reason everything else won't stop
is because you've lost in your heart.

16:36.330 --> 16:38.710
The Winged Monarch? What a laugh!

16:38.710 --> 16:41.580
Right now, your heart is too beaten down
to rule over anything.

16:41.580 --> 16:43.170
You're more like Traumatia now.

16:44.500 --> 16:46.540
Traumatia?

16:51.960 --> 16:53.960
What should I do?

16:54.670 --> 16:57.750
What do I need to do to use
Time Control Magic again?

16:58.000 --> 16:59.460
That's a piece of cake.

16:59.460 --> 17:01.290
You gotta forget your fear.

17:02.250 --> 17:03.670
Take that sword.

17:04.040 --> 17:05.630
You were afraid of it at first,

17:05.630 --> 17:07.920
but then you grabbed it without faltering
and cut me down.

17:08.500 --> 17:12.130
For a second, you forgot your fear
because of the rage you felt towards me.

17:12.420 --> 17:15.380
Forget my fear...

17:15.750 --> 17:17.750
Forget my fear of the enemy...

17:20.170 --> 17:22.130
Don't act like it's so easy!

17:22.130 --> 17:24.710
If it was that straightforward,
I wouldn't be struggling like this!

17:24.710 --> 17:26.710
Command me.

17:27.630 --> 17:30.670
Command me to obliterate
the source of your fear,

17:30.670 --> 17:32.920
and your fear will be a thing of the past.

17:33.290 --> 17:34.630
Say it.

17:34.630 --> 17:36.880
What do you want me to do?

17:40.880 --> 17:43.250
No. I won't command you.

17:43.250 --> 17:44.170
What?

17:44.170 --> 17:48.210
Losing my Time Control Magic is simply
my own personal failure.

17:48.210 --> 17:53.130
I can't use you, my greatest weapon,
to get my power back.

17:53.580 --> 17:55.960
Right now, the top priority is
to annihilate this country

17:55.960 --> 18:00.540
so the world can be shaped as God desires.

18:00.920 --> 18:04.500
That is my sole duty as
the Winged Progenitor.

18:04.500 --> 18:07.460
Well, I didn't want the answer
I should use to ace the test.

18:07.460 --> 18:09.460
Tell me what you really want.
What you truly desire.

18:09.460 --> 18:10.790
What?

18:10.790 --> 18:14.040
What you really want me to do is...

18:14.040 --> 18:15.500
get revenge, right?

18:21.290 --> 18:24.210
Then how 'bout I tell you
what I really want first?

18:24.210 --> 18:29.460
It enrages me that some bastard
tried to kill my woman while I was gone.

18:33.130 --> 18:35.630
Since when did I become your woman!

18:36.670 --> 18:42.630
How long will you insist on clowning around
and making a fool of me!

18:42.630 --> 18:47.960
If you don't intend on listening to me,
go ahead and fight! That's fine by me!

18:47.960 --> 18:51.170
I want to fight because you ordered me to.

18:51.460 --> 18:54.170
I'm not gonna bow and scrape
because you're the progenitor

18:54.170 --> 18:56.380
or worship you like some saint.

18:56.380 --> 19:00.000
To me, you're just an unhinged woman.

19:00.000 --> 19:01.000
An unhin-?

19:01.000 --> 19:04.080
And I'm following this unhinged woman
of my own volition.

19:04.080 --> 19:06.210
I don't give a rat's ass about God,
or allegiance to our blood,

19:06.210 --> 19:07.750
or any of that garbage.

19:10.250 --> 19:14.540
So you can act however you want around me.

19:15.040 --> 19:16.960
You can piss and moan about your problems.

19:16.960 --> 19:18.960
You can blow your top and bawl your eyes out.

19:18.960 --> 19:21.250
You can be selfish like a child.

19:21.250 --> 19:25.540
For you, I can take it all.
I'll always be by your side.

19:25.880 --> 19:29.750
Th-there's no way
I can allow that for myself.

19:29.750 --> 19:32.880
I have a duty to my God and bloodline.

19:32.880 --> 19:37.000
And above all, I have a duty to the
immense number of people we've killed.

19:37.000 --> 19:38.330
My personal desires-

19:38.330 --> 19:41.540
And I don't doubt that those are
your true feelings.

19:41.880 --> 19:44.750
But that's not what I'm trying to ask you.

19:45.500 --> 19:46.920
Say it.

19:46.920 --> 19:48.960
Tell me what you want me to do.

19:54.330 --> 19:56.830
Bring... me...

19:58.290 --> 19:59.920
their heads.

20:03.790 --> 20:05.710
I actually said it.

20:06.330 --> 20:08.580
Everything is their fault.

20:08.580 --> 20:10.790
If it wasn't for them...

20:10.790 --> 20:12.080
I'm sick of it...

20:12.080 --> 20:14.330
I'm sick of it! I'm so sick of it!

20:14.330 --> 20:16.710
I cannot bear it any longer!

20:16.710 --> 20:21.210
Why is it that we're the only ones who suffer
while they get to continue living?

20:21.210 --> 20:24.330
It's simply not fair!

20:24.880 --> 20:27.130
This is an order, Woltekamui!

20:27.130 --> 20:28.880
Kill them!

20:29.420 --> 20:33.290
Use the full extent of your
phenomenal fighting prowess!

20:33.630 --> 20:38.920
Rip off their heads and bring them to me!

20:42.420 --> 20:44.420
Attagirl.

20:44.420 --> 20:45.830
Leave it to me.

20:46.040 --> 20:48.880
Your wish is my command.

20:55.460 --> 20:56.380
Tia!

20:56.380 --> 20:58.040
Lady Ultimatia!

21:00.750 --> 21:02.500
I'm sorry, Tia!

21:02.500 --> 21:04.710
I wasn't there when you really needed me.

21:04.710 --> 21:07.880
No, I'm sorry for making you worry!

21:07.880 --> 21:10.290
I'm okay now.

21:10.710 --> 21:12.790
Oh, that's right! Nebulim!

21:13.290 --> 21:15.250
Are you all right?

21:15.250 --> 21:19.420
This oaf threatened you into letting him
into my chamber, didn't he?

21:19.420 --> 21:23.290
The kiddo said it was totally cool
for me to go in. Right?

21:23.290 --> 21:24.670
You liar!
It is true, Lady Ultimatia.<b></b>

21:24.670 --> 21:26.500
Nebulim would never disobey my orders.
It is true, Lady Ultimatia.<b></b>

21:26.500 --> 21:28.750
Nebulim would never disobey my orders.
I let Kamui walk right in.<b></b>

21:28.750 --> 21:29.210
He's a good boy, unlike you.

21:29.210 --> 21:31.130
He's a good boy, unlike you.
Given the state you were in,<b></b>

21:31.130 --> 21:34.210
You shouldn't set such high expectations
for kiddos, ya know?
I knew only Kamui's words<b>
</b>would get through to you.<b></b>

21:34.210 --> 21:37.630
You have some nerve trying to admonish me!
What can I do to get closer to<b>
</b>Lady Ultimatia's heart?<b></b>

21:37.630 --> 21:38.420
What can I do to get closer to
Lady Ultimatia's heart?

21:39.290 --> 21:41.380
As close as he is to her...

21:45.380 --> 21:47.330
What was that? Huh?

21:47.580 --> 21:49.080
The Reaper...

21:49.750 --> 21:51.460
will...

21:52.330 --> 21:53.960
hunt you!

21:54.750 --> 21:57.380
That guy really got my hopes up.

21:57.380 --> 22:00.170
When was the last time I felt
this pumped to fight someone?

22:00.170 --> 22:01.960
And an opponent I've never even seen!

22:01.960 --> 22:05.790
When we finally face down, let's have a fight
to the death that'll go down in history!

22:06.130 --> 22:09.920
Whaddaya think, Reaper?
